---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import VisaFeeCalculator from '../../components/tools/VisaFeeCalculator.jsx';
import { visaFees, checked } from '../../data/visa-fees.js';
const schema = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'WebApplication', name: 'Visa Fee Calculator', applicationCategory: 'TravelApplication', operatingSystem: 'Any', offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '0', priceCurrency: 'USD' } };
---
<BaseLayout title="Visa Fee Calculator: Official Fees & PKR Estimates" description="Check sourced UK, US, Canada and Schengen base visa fees in their original currencies, with exchange-rate estimates and official links for other destinations." schema={schema}>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Visa Fee Calculator</h1>
    <p class="mb-8">Compare base application fees without confusing pounds, US dollars, Canadian dollars and euros. Fees checked {checked}; confirm the official amount before payment.</p>
    <VisaFeeCalculator client:load />
    <section class="prose max-w-none mt-10">
      <h2>Verified base fees</h2>
      <ul>{visaFees.map(fee => <li>{fee.country} — {fee.type}: <strong>{fee.currency} {fee.amount}</strong>. <a href={fee.source}>Official source</a>.</li>)}</ul>
      <h2>How the conversion works</h2>
      <p>Choose a destination/category and output currency. We preserve each fee’s original currency, then convert through reference rates from the same provider. The tool shows the rate date and withholds conversion if rates cannot be loaded or are more than 72 hours old. Original fees remain visible.</p>
      <p>For example, a CAD fee must first be valued in CAD. Treating CAD 100 as USD 100 would overstate its value. Our conversion accounts for the source currency rather than treating every number as US dollars.</p>
      <h2>What your final bill may include</h2>
      <p>Budget separately for applicable biometrics, healthcare surcharges, SEVIS, insurance, translations, application-centre services, courier and card/bank charges. Whether a cost is included, separate, optional or exempt depends on the route. An estimated PKR conversion is not the embassy’s payable PKR amount.</p>
      <h2>Children, refunds and changes</h2>
      <p>Age reductions, family fee caps and exemptions vary. Refund rules also depend on the authority and application stage. Use the official fee service for your exact circumstances; do not assume one country’s rules apply elsewhere.</p>
      <p>Not every category has a verified figure here. Official links for other destinations help you get the current amount without relying on an old quote. Then check <a href="/tools/visa-processing-time/">processing information</a> and prepare your <a href="/tools/document-checklist-generator/">document checklist</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
